  m_text: "<size=60>Created by\nAndres Maldonado\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<size=50>Portrait Goobers\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<size=50>Assets
    Used\n\n<size=30>Megapoly.Art Vintage Control Room\nFries and Seagull Bar / Interior\nPoeme
    City Voxel Pack\nsametsylmz3d Stylized - Simple Hands\n\nSound Effects sourced
    from Soundly\nSound Design done with FMOD\nMusic sourced from Myself >:)\n\n\n\n\n<size=50>Special
    Thanks\n<size=30>\nAmy Maldonado\nRene Maldonado\nEmily Maldonado\nNick Heitzman\nEamon
    O'Connor\nAaron Karlson\nMiles Haase\nJulian Riley\nJoshua Buonocore\nJavonne
    Montgomery\nLia Rodriguez\n\n\n<size=40>And You!\n\nThank You For \nPlaying My
    Game!"
